</table>

<h2 id="sec-3">daisyUI 组件清单</h2>

<code>daisyui=组件名,组件名,...</code> 按需加载，可用组件（节选）：

<pre>button, card, navbar, hero, menu, badge, input, alert,
dropdown, modal, tabs, tooltip, progress, loading, avatar</pre>

完整清单见 https://daisyui.com/docs/cdn/

<h2 id="sec-4">daisyUI 主题</h2>

<code>daisyui-theme=主题名</code> 可选主题（节选）：

<pre>light, dark, cupcake, bumblebee, emerald, corporate,
synthwave, retro, cyberpunk, valentine, halloween,
garden, forest, aqua, lofi, pastel, fantasy, wireframe,
black, luxury, dracula, cmyk, autumn, business, acid,
lemonade, night, coffee, winter</pre>

完整清单见 https://daisyui.com/docs/themes/

<div class="alert alert-warning my-4">
<span><strong>注意</strong><br/>未登记的库名会被忽略，不会加载任何内容。新增库需在 [[Module:Libs]] 注册表中登记。</span>
</div>

